 "remarks": "Sleek, sophisticated and set directly on the shores of LI Sound, this exquisite contemporary beach house offers an unparalleled coastal lifestyle. With a private beach and exclusive boat mooring at your doorstep making every day feel like a getaway. Located in the highly sought-after Shippan Point neighborhood, this stunning home delivers breathtaking water views of Stamford Harbor and its passing boats from nearly every vantage point. Step inside to warm white oak flooring and an open-concept layout designed to blend style with ease of living. The first-floor primary suite includes a spacious bathroom and walk-in closet, and direct access to the waterfront, inviting quiet moments soaking in the view. The living area is a true showstopper: a custom contemporary wood-paneled entertainment center paired with a cozy wood-burning fireplace for lively gatherings and quiet evenings alike. At the heart of the home, an exceptional kitchen flows seamlessly into the family and dining areas, a space made for both elegant entertaining and everyday life. Also on this level, a versatile second bedroom doubles as a home office or guest retreat. Upstairs, 2 additional spacious bedrooms and a beautifully appointed bathroom complete the upper level, where sweeping water views frame the Stamford Lighthouse. Experience an endless vacation lifestyle in this captivating beachside retreat. Available for annual or short-term furnished rentals (3+ months). Inquire today for rates and availability.",
